Z||000002||TRiAD||11-16-2001||05:05 PM||||Cool!<P>Yeah, I know there are other "cheaper" harnesses out there, but I need DOT LEGAL, since I'll be using them on the street*, and Schroth is the only one that is. <P>(*fractured sturnum; normal belt would kill me in a wreck)<P>Thanks!||||reg||1
Z||000003||1FST2M6||11-16-2001||05:21 PM||||a harness will only be functional if you have the correct seat. not a factory unit. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.corbeau.com" TARGET=_blank>www.corbeau.com</A>  , <A HREF="http://www.wheel1.com" TARGET=_blank>www.wheel1.com</A>  (momo), <A HREF="http://www.jamex.com" TARGET=_blank>www.jamex.com</A>  and <A HREF="http://www.jamex.nl" TARGET=_blank>www.jamex.nl</A>  , or a Sparco.  ||||reg||1
